{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15212440","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15212440","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1521244001:1":{"text":"수스, 평소의 실력 같지 않군.","source_cn":"索斯，这似乎不是你平时的实力。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB26C23C5DC939C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1521244002:0":{"text":"...죄송합니다. 상태가 안 좋아서요.","source_cn":"……抱歉，状态不好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE209F27F38F8EE78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1521244003:0":{"text":"변명하지 마라. 부상은 부상이다.","source_cn":"别找借口，受伤就是受伤。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99920F01848DEACD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1521244004:0":{"text":"루르가 다쳤을 때는 가서 쉬라고 하더니, 네가 다치고 난 뒤에는 왜 아무런 말도 하지 않았지?","source_cn":"鲁受伤的时候你还劝他回去休息，怎么轮到自己就一声不吭了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63510C2CA32CE76B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1521244005:0":{"text":"그냥 팔만 조금 다친 거라서요. 괜찮습니다.","source_cn":"只是胳膊受了一点伤，不算什么。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE80940A35540E064","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},